<blockquote>Report your findings to the man under the Grey Bridge as before.</blockquote><blockquote>It will be at Panyana, somewhere low-key. We don't know if it is a stone, or a diagram or what. Be on the lookout for anything that might be the Rebus.</blockquote><blockquote>Do not arouse suspicion, maintain your cover at all costs. Speak little, but well. You will assume the role of a desk-bound square, so it's the perfect excuse.</blockquote><blockquote>Remember, unravelling the Rebus will bring us all closer to the Aetherium come the end, if we crack it, the Kioki will fold before us. Our family depends on you.</blockquote><blockquote>Report back from the black isle as soon as you are able.</blockquote><blockquote>We are god.</blockquote>
